{'symbol': 'STE', 'date': '2023-05-03 16:30:00', 'title': 'STERIS APPOINTS ESTHER M. ALEGRIA, PH.D.', 'text': 'DUBLIN, IRELAND, MAY 03, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- STERIS PLC (NYSE: STE) (“STERIS” OR THE “COMPANY”) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ESTHER M. ALEGRIA, PH.D. HAS BEEN ELECTED TO THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS, EFFECTIVE TODAY.'}